# My suggestion for Lloyds onboarding

Create **one reusable fictional company** and use it everywhere.

```text
Entity : ALITTNER01M1

Company : Alex Littner Test Ltd

Bank : Lloyds Bank PLC

Country : United Kingdom
```

Then create different transactions:

```text
ILC-2026-001

EC-2026-001

BG-2026-001
```

This makes it much easier to understand the end-to-end LOTS flow.
